        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled near the majestic Temple of Esna, a collection of quaint "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "em"
              ],
              "text": "ahwas"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " (coffeehouses) provide a perfect respite for travelers. These charming establishments, often with inviting terraces, are idyllic spots to experience the local café culture. Here, one can savor an array of drinks ranging from traditional Egyptian coffee to refreshing teas, perfect for rejuvenating after "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "exploring"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " the town’s historical treasures."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
